{"task_id": "Mbpp/84", "solution": "_memo = {}\n\ndef sequence(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the nth number in the Newman-Conway sequence.\n    This function uses memoization to store previously computed values.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n in _memo:\n        return _memo[n]\n\n    if n == 1 or n == 2:\n        _memo[n] = 1\n        return 1\n    else:\n        # P(n) = P(P(n-1)) + P(n-P(n-1))\n        p_n_minus_1 = sequence(n - 1)\n        result = sequence(p_n_minus_1) + sequence(n - p_n_minus_1)\n        _memo[n] = result\n        return result"}
