{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def _factorial(num):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer.\n    Assumes non-negative input for calculation.\n    \"\"\"\n    if num == 0:\n        return 1\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(1, num + 1):\n        result *= i\n    return result\n\ndef _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\n    It computes n! / (k! * (n-k)!).\n    \"\"\"\n    numerator = _factorial(n)\n    denominator = _factorial(k) * _factorial(n - k)\n    return numerator // denominator\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sum of even index binomial coefficients for a positive integer n.\n    It sums C(n, k) for k = 0, 2, 4, ..., up to n.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return total_sum"}
