{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def _factorial(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    if num == 0:\n        return 1\n    result = 1\n    for i in range(1, num + 1):\n        result *= i\n    return result\n\ndef _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the binomial coefficient C(n, k).\"\"\"\n    # Optimization: C(n, k) = C(n, n-k)\n    # Use the smaller of k and n-k for fewer factorial computations\n    if k > n // 2:\n        k = n - k\n        \n    numerator = _factorial(n)\n    denominator = _factorial(k) * _factorial(n - k)\n    \n    return numerator // denominator\n\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\n    This sum is C(n,0) + C(n,2) + C(n,4) + ...\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Iterate for even indices k from 0 up to n (inclusive)\n    for k in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total_sum += _calculate_binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    \n    return total_sum"}
