{"task_id": "Mbpp/287", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of squares of the first n even natural numbers.\n    \"\"\"\n    def _generate_even_numbers(count: int) -> list[int]:\n        \"\"\"Generates a list of the first 'count' even natural numbers.\"\"\"\n        return [2 * (i + 1) for i in range(count)]\n\n    def _calculate_squares_sum(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of squares for a given list of numbers.\"\"\"\n        return sum(x * x for x in numbers)\n\n    even_numbers = _generate_even_numbers(n)\n    return _calculate_squares_sum(even_numbers)"}
