{"task_id": "Mbpp/420", "solution": "def cube_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the cubes of the first n even natural numbers.\n    Utilizes a mathematical formula for efficient computation.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    # The sum of cubes of the first n even numbers (2i)^3 for i=1 to n\n    # is 8 * (sum of i^3 for i=1 to n).\n    # The sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers is (n * (n + 1) / 2)^2.\n    sum_of_n_cubes = (n * (n + 1) // 2) ** 2\n    return 8 * sum_of_n_cubes"}
