{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    # Handle the special case for 0 explicitly, though the loop would also yield 0\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Extract and sum digits using modulo and integer division\n    while n > 0:\n        total_sum += n % 10  # Get the last digit\n        n //= 10             # Remove the last digit\n            \n    return total_sum"}
