{"task_id": "Mbpp/598", "solution": "def armstrong_number(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the given number is an Armstrong number.\n    An Armstrong number is equal to the sum of its digits each raised to the power of the total number of digits.\n    \"\"\"\n\n    def _extract_digits(n: int) -> list:\n        \"\"\"Extracts individual digits from a number.\"\"\"\n        return [int(d) for d in str(n)]\n\n    def _calculate_power_sum(digits_list: list, power: int) -> int:\n        \"\"\"Calculates the sum of digits raised to a specified power.\"\"\"\n        current_sum = 0\n        for digit in digits_list:\n            current_sum += digit ** power\n        return current_sum\n\n    if number < 0:\n        return False\n    \n    original_number = number\n    \n    digits = _extract_digits(number)\n    num_digits = len(digits)\n\n    calculated_sum = _calculate_power_sum(digits, num_digits)\n\n    return calculated_sum == original_number"}
