{"task_id": "Mbpp/632", "solution": "def move_zero(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Moves all zero values to the end of the list while preserving the relative order of non-zero elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    non_zeros = []\n    zero_count = 0\n\n    for element in input_list:\n        if element == 0:\n            zero_count += 1\n        else:\n            non_zeros.append(element)\n\n    # Append all collected zeros to the end of the non-zero elements list\n    non_zeros.extend([0] * zero_count)\n\n    return non_zeros"}
