{"task_id": "Mbpp/724", "solution": "def power_base_sum(base: int, power: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculate the sum of all digits of the base to the specified power.\"\"\"\n    # Calculate the power of the base\n    result = base ** power\n\n    # Convert the result to a string to extract digits\n    result_str = str(result)\n\n    # Sum the individual digits\n    digit_sum = sum(int(digit) for digit in result_str)\n\n    return digit_sum"}
