{"task_id": "Mbpp/748", "solution": "```python\ndef capital_words_spaces(input_string: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Inserts spaces before capital letters that indicate the start of new words,\n    preserving existing capitalization.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not input_string:\n        return \"\"\n\n    result_chars = []\n    for i, char in enumerate(input_string):\n        # Insert a space if the character is an uppercase letter,\n        # it's not the first character, and the previous character is not already a space.\n        if char.isupper() and i > 0 and input_string[i - 1] != ' ':\n            result_chars.append(' ')\n        result_chars.append(char)\n\n    return \"\".join(result_chars)\n```"}
