{"task_id": "Mbpp/754", "solution": "def extract_index_list(l1, l2, l3):\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds elements that appear at the same index in all three input lists.\n    Returns a list of these common elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    common_elements = []\n    min_len = min(len(l1), len(l2), len(l3))\n\n    for i in range(min_len):\n        if l1[i] == l2[i] == l3[i]:\n            common_elements.append(l1[i])\n\n    return common_elements"}
