{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "solution": "def find_min_diff(array: tuple, length: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the minimum absolute difference between any two elements in the given array.\n    Assumes the array contains integers and has at least two elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    min_difference = float('inf')\n\n    for i in range(length):\n        for j in range(i + 1, length):\n            current_diff = abs(array[i] - array[j])\n            if current_diff < min_difference:\n                min_difference = current_diff\n\n    return int(min_difference)"}
