{"task_id": "Mbpp/767", "solution": "def get_pairs_count(numbers, target_sum):\n    \"\"\"Counts the number of pairs in a list that sum up to a target value.\n    Each occurrence of a number is treated as a distinct element.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    n = len(numbers)\n\n    # Iterate through all possible unique pairs of indices (i, j) where i < j\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if numbers[i] + numbers[j] == target_sum:\n                count += 1\n    return count"}
