{"task_id": "Mbpp/805", "solution": "def _calculate_sum(inner_list):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of elements in a single list.\"\"\"\n    return sum(inner_list)\n\ndef _find_max_index(sums):\n    \"\"\"Finds the index of the first occurrence of the maximum value in a list.\"\"\"\n    if not sums:\n        return 0 # Assumes non-empty input based on problem statement and assert.\n\n    max_value = max(sums)\n    for i, value in enumerate(sums):\n        if value == max_value:\n            return i\n    return -1 # Should not be reached if 'sums' is non-empty.\n\ndef max_sum_list(lists_of_lists):\n    \"\"\"\n    Returns the list in a list of lists whose sum of elements is the highest.\n    \"\"\"\n    all_sums = []\n    for inner_list in lists_of_lists:\n        all_sums.append(_calculate_sum(inner_list))\n\n    max_index = _find_max_index(all_sums)\n\n    return lists_of_lists[max_index]"}
